    "identifier": "early-sacrifice",
    "description": "<p>After dodging an enemy’s melee attack, you leap on their shoulder and attempt to throw them 30 feet in a direction of your choice. The target must make a Strength saving throw, being thrown 30 feet in a straight line, in a direction of your choice.</p>\n<p>A thrown target must make a Dexterity saving throw, landing Prone on a failed save.</p>\n<p>If the target hits a surface such as a wall, ceiling, or large or larger object they take damage as if they were falling.</p>",
